  m_title: Movement
  m_description: 'Use <sprite name=w><sprite name=a><sprite name=s><sprite name=d> 
    to walk

    Hold <sprite name=shift> to run

    Press <sprite name=space> to
    jump

    Press <sprite name=shift> to evade

    Press <sprite name=ctrl> to
    crouch

    Press <sprite name=c> while running (<sprite name=shift>) to slide'
